{"3565650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drone Simulator VR", "steam_appid": 3565650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4481890], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE IMMERSIVE SIMULATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic drone physics deliver an authentic flying experience, while the collision system provides convincing drone damage. Atmospheric worlds and sound design based on real drone recordings draw you deeper into the simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/177f9b61d7cdb138c3da75ac6dc9c134.poster.avif?t=1782983309\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/177f9b61d7cdb138c3da75ac6dc9c134.webm?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/177f9b61d7cdb138c3da75ac6dc9c134.mp4?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your drone by line of sight, through the virtual control monitor, or directly from the FPV perspective. Choose between the Flight Modes Tripod, Positioning, and Sport, plus three different control layouts. Optional propeller guards add extra safety during collisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/b96b5fc018e0247be9646508fcdfedb0.poster.avif?t=1782983309\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/b96b5fc018e0247be9646508fcdfedb0.webm?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/b96b5fc018e0247be9646508fcdfedb0.mp4?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROVE YOUR SKILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New challenges await on unlockable maps: master Photospots by precisely aligning the drone, Gimbal, and Zoom, complete Delivery missions, or discover hidden Collectables. In Time Trials, compete with pilots from around the world for the top spots on the global Leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/a9be8284169484a1a79ec8105a5ed519.poster.avif?t=1782983309\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/a9be8284169484a1a79ec8105a5ed519.webm?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/a9be8284169484a1a79ec8105a5ed519.mp4?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND YOUR HANGAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a professional camera drone to an agricultural drone with a three-meter wingspan, each new drone offers a distinct flying experience. Unlock more models and customize them with new colors to match your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/c1356bf4e56b0e313556460ac3686a64.poster.avif?t=1782983309\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/c1356bf4e56b0e313556460ac3686a64.webm?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/c1356bf4e56b0e313556460ac3686a64.mp4?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE IMMERSIVE SIMULATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic drone physics deliver an authentic flying experience, while the collision system provides convincing drone damage. Atmospheric worlds and sound design based on real drone recordings draw you deeper into the simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/177f9b61d7cdb138c3da75ac6dc9c134.poster.avif?t=1782983309\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/177f9b61d7cdb138c3da75ac6dc9c134.webm?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/177f9b61d7cdb138c3da75ac6dc9c134.mp4?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TAKE CONTROL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly your drone by line of sight, through the virtual control monitor, or directly from the FPV perspective. Choose between the Flight Modes Tripod, Positioning, and Sport, plus three different control layouts. Optional propeller guards add extra safety during collisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/b96b5fc018e0247be9646508fcdfedb0.poster.avif?t=1782983309\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/b96b5fc018e0247be9646508fcdfedb0.webm?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/b96b5fc018e0247be9646508fcdfedb0.mp4?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROVE YOUR SKILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New challenges await on unlockable maps: master Photospots by precisely aligning the drone, Gimbal, and Zoom, complete Delivery missions, or discover hidden Collectables. In Time Trials, compete with pilots from around the world for the top spots on the global Leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/a9be8284169484a1a79ec8105a5ed519.poster.avif?t=1782983309\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/a9be8284169484a1a79ec8105a5ed519.webm?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/a9be8284169484a1a79ec8105a5ed519.mp4?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND YOUR HANGAR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a professional camera drone to an agricultural drone with a three-meter wingspan, each new drone offers a distinct flying experience. Unlock more models and customize them with new colors to match your personal style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/c1356bf4e56b0e313556460ac3686a64.poster.avif?t=1782983309\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/c1356bf4e56b0e313556460ac3686a64.webm?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565650/extras/c1356bf4e56b0e313556460ac3686a64.mp4?t=1782983309\" type=\"video/mp4\